p.src:
Let us freeze compensation and turbulence and compare two stylized firms. Firm $A$ is rich in perks but poor in care and development; Firm $B$ is the reverse: $\begin{aligned}
A &: (C,G,P) = (1,1,3),\\
B &: (C,G,P) = (3,3,1).\end{aligned}$ Then the mnemonic score gives $\begin{aligned}
S_{\text{stay}}(A) &= C_A + G_A = 1+1 = 2,\\
S_{\text{stay}}(B) &= C_B + G_B = 3+3 = 6.\end{aligned}$

